{"id": "t149-060", "text": "Kwame long call tonight - Finn's dad's funeral was Monday, lovely service, loads of people. Finn did a reading + held it together till the end. they're both shattered. Finn's mum staying with them for a bit, she's not coping on her own. Kwame says Finn's back at work next week but prob too soon. remind me to ring K Thurs, and maybe send Finn a book - he's into Tolkien, has everything already tho. ask Kwame", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "shattered", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not coping on her own", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring K", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "K", "pronoun": "unknown", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thurs", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Finn a book", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p8", "type"